        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Lloyd, Julia Gillard, Trent O'Donnell, Tim Mathieson, Myles Barlow\n- TV Series: Review with Myles Barlow, At Home with Julia, A Moody Christmas\n- Organizations: Australian Labor Party, Jungleboys\n- Roles: Prime Minister of Australia\n\nFacts:\n- Julia Gillard was born on 29 September 1961.\n- Julia Gillard was the 27th Prime Minister of Australia from 2010 to 2013 as Leader of the Australian Labor Party.\n- Phil Lloyd is best known for playing Myles Barlow in the Australian TV series Review with Myles Barlow.\n- Phil Lloyd played Tim Mathieson, the partner of Prime Minister Julia Gillard, in the comedy series At Home with Julia.\n- A Moody Christmas was written and created by Trent O'Donnell and Phil Lloyd at Jungleboys.\n- Trent O'Donnell directed A Moody Christmas.",
